# This Worker's own secrets (CI: written to .dev.vars by the job, never
# committed). HARNESS_SECRET stays venture-local; SIDECAR_GATEWAY_SECRET
# must hold the same value the host Worker carries, or every forwarded
# event arrives unstamped and the mount is dead on arrival.
HARNESS_SECRET=replace-with-this-workers-own-secret
SIDECAR_GATEWAY_SECRET=replace-with-the-value-shared-with-the-host
